@q 3:38-41

Low farm productivity comes from **population pressure on land, small and fragmented holdings, disguised unemployment** and rain dependence; co-operative farming is a proposed remedy, not a cause. Only **State governments** can tax **agricultural income** (State List). In UP the largest share of workers is in **agriculture**.

